msgid "Makes this Wayland desktop reachable from RealVNC Viewer on your phone or another computer. It listens on this computer only until you turn on Local Network Access."
msgstr "Ndadekake desktop Wayland iki bisa digayuh saka RealVNC Viewer ing telpon utawa komputer liyane. Mung ngrungokake ing komputer iki nganti sampeyan nguripake Akses Jaringan Lokal."

